techniques (Table 6). The four axes are separated by vertical lines, and for each KA, the techniques of each axis sum up to
one. For instance, 10% of studies assigned to SE Management employ computational search and optimisation techniques,
30% employ fuzzy and probabilistic methods, and 60% employ classification, learning, and prediction techniques. As
